{"src":"de","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":198400,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"de","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":8680.793714,"text":"Im Jahr 1990 wurde es aufgrund der Bedrohung durch Wüstensand zur Liste der gefährdeten Weltkulturerbegebiete hinzugefügt."},{"kind":"text","t":9083.713848,"text":"In 1990, it was added to the list of endangered World Heritage sites due to the threat from desert sand."},{"kind":"audio","t":9138.554409,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9140.640926,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9141.968722,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9142.824078,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":9144.612587,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9146.301566,"samples":32360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":770},{"kind":"input","t":13972.486767,"text":"Wenn Sie den Film Das Vermächtnis der Tempelritter gesehen haben,"},{"kind":"text","t":14193.121925,"text":"If you’ve watched the movie The Templar Legacy,"},{"kind":"audio","t":14236.741698,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14238.349764999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14238.716747,"samples":15464,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":40},{"kind":"input","t":20421.753706000003,"text":"Denken Sie vielleicht, dass auf der Rückseite der Unabhängigkeitserklärung eine Schatzkarte gezeichnet wurde."},{"kind":"text","t":20722.793695,"text":"You might think that a treasure map was drawn on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"audio","t":20769.181099,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20771.190319,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20772.590023,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20774.307946,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":20774.645643,"samples":12928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":32507.375543000002,"text":"Kinder werden aus einer Vielzahl von Gründen in Pflegefamilien untergebracht, und zwar aus verschiedenen Gründen, die von Vernachlässigung über Missbrauch bis hin zur Erpressung reichen."},{"kind":"text","t":32819.501448,"text":"Children are placed in foster families for various reasons, ranging from neglect and abuse to coercion."},{"kind":"audio","t":32867.825022000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":32869.307941,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":32871.047045,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":32872.889165,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":32874.696912,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":32875.579349,"samples":20960,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":250},{"kind":"input","t":42462.550037,"text":"Das Cochamotal Chiles wichtigstes Kletterziel, bekannt als der Yosemite National Park von Südamerika mit einer Vielzahl von großen Granitwänden und Klippen."},{"kind":"text","t":42977.175176000004,"text":"Cochamó Tal is Chile’s most important climbing destination, known as South America’s Yosemite National Park, with a multitude of large granite walls and cliffs."},{"kind":"audio","t":43034.425309,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":43035.851764,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":160,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43037.686782000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43039.544875,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43041.315016,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43043.076124,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":970},{"kind":"audio","t":43044.900887,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43046.710097,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43048.044373000004,"samples":27056,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":530},{"kind":"input","t":48189.048857,"text":"Aristoteles Ansichten zu allen Wissenschaftsfragen einschließlich der Psychologie waren anerkannt."},{"kind":"text","t":48462.967325000005,"text":"Aristotle’s views on all scientific matters, including psychology, were recognized."},{"kind":"audio","t":48508.126883000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":48509.751716,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":48511.594466,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":48513.322774,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":48514.551531000005,"samples":26728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":570},{"kind":"input","t":57762.821294,"text":"Wenn Sie es nicht gewohnt sind, auf Landstraßen zu fahren, bleiben Sie achtsam. Steiles Gefälle, enge Fahrbahnen und scharfe Kurven überwiegen hier."},{"kind":"text","t":58034.011351,"text":"If you’re not used to driving on country roads, stay cautious. Steep slopes, narrow roads, and sharp turns predominate here."},{"kind":"audio","t":58078.942315,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58080.527498,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":58082.292702,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":58082.462917000004,"samples":9696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":58124.303426,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58125.70309,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":58127.388884,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":58127.620172,"samples":9696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":70131.29989699999,"text":"Die Gegenwart eines echten, unsichtbaren Teams, Larson und LaFasto, 1989, Seite 109."},{"kind":"text","t":70568.040864,"text":"The presence of a real, invisible team, Larson and LaFasto, 1989, page 109."},{"kind":"audio","t":70618.54060899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":70619.91783899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":70621.58819,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":360,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":70623.395718,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":70625.39036599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":70626.729499,"samples":30560,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":620},{"kind":"input","t":72314.07929,"text":"ist auch ein einzigartiger Bestandteil eines virtuellen Teams."},{"kind":"text","t":72515.000302,"text":"It is also a unique component of a virtual team."},{"kind":"audio","t":72559.02410299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":72560.511028,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":72562.105915,"samples":32264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":760},{"kind":"input","t":81099.19712299999,"text":"Nach dem Unfall wurde Gibson in ein Krankenhaus gebracht."},{"kind":"text","t":81298.09233,"text":"After the accident, Gibson was taken to a hospital."},{"kind":"audio","t":81342.012574,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":81344.247775,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":330,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":81345.70418399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":81345.82848099999,"samples":2496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":85084.154698,"text":"Er verstarb jedoch kurz darauf."},{"kind":"text","t":85206.30552499999,"text":"He passed away shortly after."},{"kind":"audio","t":85258.73097599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":85259.701665,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":810},{"kind":"audio","t":85259.90746399999,"samples":464,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":90143.54478299999,"text":"Viele deutsche Backwaren beinhalten außerdem Mandeln, Haselnüsse oder andere Nüsse."},{"kind":"text","t":90412.963156,"text":"Many German baked goods also contain almonds, hazelnuts, or other nuts."},{"kind":"audio","t":90458.661914,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90460.82510599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90462.187905,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":90464.038076,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":90464.156945,"samples":3928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":95226.792512,"text":"Beliebte Kuchen passen häufig besonders gut zu einer Tasse starken Kaffees."},{"kind":"text","t":95459.444886,"text":"Popular cakes often pair especially well with a cup of strong coffee."},{"kind":"audio","t":95505.13034399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":95506.540073,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":95508.276424,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":95509.562467,"samples":27696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"input","t":100336.587911,"text":"Wenn man eine romanische Sprache spricht, ist es natürlich leichter, Portugiesisch zu erlernen."},{"kind":"text","t":100596.449408,"text":"If you speak a Romance language, it’s naturally easier to learn Portuguese."},{"kind":"audio","t":100641.344418,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100643.30354299999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100644.769787,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":100646.48969199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":100646.620619,"samples":2128,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":107906.586331,"text":"Die Klang- und Lichtshow bei den Pyramiden ist eine der interessantesten Attraktionen für Kinder in der Gegend."},{"kind":"text","t":108266.31003899999,"text":"The sound and light show at the pyramids is one of the most interesting attractions for children in the area."},{"kind":"audio","t":108316.32577699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108317.791761,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108319.47247699999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108321.31581799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":108323.100051,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":108323.35114799999,"samples":11960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":118562.155068,"text":"Verkehrsfluss ist die Untersuchung der Bewegung einzelner Fahrer und Fahrzeuge zwischen zwei Punkten und der Interaktionen, die zwischen beiden stattfinden."},{"kind":"text","t":118952.39515099999,"text":"Traffic flow is the study of the movement of individual drivers and vehicles between two points and the interactions that occur between them."},{"kind":"audio","t":119005.12637099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":119007.04519599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119008.479612,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119010.238606,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119011.98536199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1070},{"kind":"audio","t":119013.84074099999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":119015.761539,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":910},{"kind":"audio","t":119015.89768299999,"samples":4024,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":129083.05783399999,"text":"der australier mitchell gurley wurde elfter im stehenden super g der männer der tschechische konkurrent aldrich jelinek wurde sechzehnter im sitzenden super g der männer"},{"kind":"text","t":129634.04438400001,"text":"Australian Mitchell Gurley finished eleventh in the men’s standing Super G, while Czech competitor Aldrich Jelinek came in sixteenth in the men’s sitting Super G."},{"kind":"audio","t":129689.264376,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129690.57741999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129692.25859700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129694.00964899999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129695.844488,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129697.691154,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129699.513454,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129700.452215,"samples":23824,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":320},{"kind":"input","t":139571.884329,"text":"Das Haitianische Institut für Gerechtigkeit und Demokratie hat auf unabhängigen Studien verwiesen, die nahelegen, dass das nepalesische UN-Friedensbataillon die Krankheit unwissentlich"},{"kind":"text","t":139989.72238,"text":"The Haitian Institute for Justice and Democracy cited independent studies suggesting that the Nepalese UN peacekeeping battalion spread the disease unintentionally"},{"kind":"audio","t":140044.296811,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":140045.921413,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":140047.559065,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":140049.337148,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":940},{"kind":"audio","t":140051.20771,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":140053.030781,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":140054.841673,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":140056.610001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":140057.81888799998,"samples":26456,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":460},{"kind":"input","t":142081.12370599998,"text":"nach Haiti eingeschleppt hat."},{"kind":"text","t":142194.24224599998,"text":"introduced to Haiti."},{"kind":"audio","t":142235.497384,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":142235.99434099998,"samples":18832,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":240},{"kind":"input","t":148195.590745,"text":"Bald nach dem Ausbruch von Kampfhandlungen initiierte Großbritannien eine Seeblockade gegen Deutschland."},{"kind":"text","t":148468.327586,"text":"Shortly after the outbreak of hostilities, Britain imposed a naval blockade on Germany."},{"kind":"audio","t":148514.27576,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148515.84437799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":148517.523762,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148519.301625,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":148520.448789,"samples":26128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":450},{"kind":"input","t":155423.88561599999,"text":"Er griff auch alles an, was ins Wasser kam. Selbst ein großer Dinosaurier wie der T-Rex war ihm nicht gewachsen."},{"kind":"text","t":155746.24362199998,"text":"He also attacked anything that entered the water. Even a giant dinosaur like the T-Rex was no match for him."},{"kind":"audio","t":155788.95885599998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":155791.130921,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155791.57657099998,"samples":20864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":270},{"kind":"audio","t":155828.02437199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155829.699921,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155831.34211,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":155832.00430499998,"samples":19296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":190},{"kind":"input","t":167503.830088,"text":"Die Verwendung von Videoaufzeichnungen führte zu wichtigen Erkenntnissen für die Deutung von Mikroexpressionen, wenige Millisekunden dauernden Gesichtsbewegungen."},{"kind":"text","t":167888.48851,"text":"The use of video recordings led to important insights for interpreting microexpressions, facial movements that last just a few milliseconds."},{"kind":"audio","t":167943.163302,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167945.45647,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167946.821501,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167948.580165,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167950.252279,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167952.113727,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167953.932732,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167954.419013,"samples":15424,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":50},{"kind":"input","t":175116.789699,"text":"Die Ankündigung erfolgte nach einem Telefongespräch von Trump mit dem türkischen Präsidenten Recep Tayyip."},{"kind":"text","t":175418.303238,"text":"The announcement came after a phone call between Trump and Turkish President Recep Tayyip."},{"kind":"audio","t":175466.058556,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175467.63379999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175469.383897,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175471.049917,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175471.716348,"samples":18928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":100},{"kind":"input","t":176671.37235299998,"text":"Ja, Dugan."},{"kind":"text","t":176794.30291199998,"text":"Yes, Dugan."},{"kind":"audio","t":176834.413476,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1250},{"kind":"audio","t":176834.71618,"samples":9832,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":185637.42733,"text":"Es gibt Familienstrände, die manchmal überlaufen sind, mit einer schönen Einkaufspromenade entlang der Küste. Das Schwimmen ist hier sicher."},{"kind":"text","t":186040.565841,"text":"There are family beaches that can be crowded at times, with a nice promenade along the coast. Swimming is safe here."},{"kind":"audio","t":186088.86839,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":186090.532097,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":186092.261363,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":186094.15022799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":186095.118411,"samples":21928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":350},{"kind":"audio","t":186124.29127699998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":186124.692219,"samples":17032,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":180},{"kind":"input","t":196962.461261,"text":"Die meisten der kleineren Inseln sind unabhängige Nationen oder zu Frankreich gehörig und als luxuriöse Seebäder"},{"kind":"text","t":197277.539801,"text":"Most of the smaller islands are independent nations or part of France and serve as luxurious seaside resorts."},{"kind":"audio","t":197316.424183,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":197317.857805,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":197319.435673,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":197321.21190999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":197323.01615799998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":197324.552473,"samples":32360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":790},{"kind":"input","t":198561.756585,"text":"Bekannt."},{"kind":"text","t":198640.930229,"text":"Famous."},{"kind":"audio","t":198680.801734,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1030},{"kind":"audio","t":198681.079821,"samples":3232,"rate":24000},{"kind":"close","t":208702.312052,"code":1005}]}